"The Ryeh-b't is a small flying reptile native to Artona 3."
"It was domesticated more than twenty thousand years ago."
"It is a popular companion animal across the Triplanets and resource worlds."
"It is swift, clever and easily trained."
"It is scaled, horned and spiny, with large wings and an upright stance like a bipedal dinosaur."
"Large breeds grow to about twice a cat's size, around fifteen pounds."
"Varieties include popular green, shy beige and rebellious black; males have skull spikes."
"Pets hatch from bought eggs and live in indoor terrariums with pools."
"Message carrying and flight competitions are only for child trainers."
